SEQUENCE:10
DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Dear all\,\n\nWe have our final episode meeting
 before the summer kicks in on Tuesday 30 June 2026 at SDU. We are working
 on finalizing the details for the day\, but we just wanted to update you o
 n a couple of things.\n\nLocation\nSDU\, meeting room M-0.60 Dialogen\, Le
 vel 0\, Building 45.6S. You can use this map<https://clients.mapsindoors.c
 om/sdu/573f26e4bc1f571b08094312/details/d4f198450c77452f82d80eb2> to guide
  you to the meeting room.\n\nProgram for the day\nThe agenda is attached a
 nd you can also find it [​docx icon]  here<https://alumni.sharepoint.com
 /:w:/r/sites/UCPH_CPDSE377/Shared%20Documents/Organization%20and%20Communi
 ty/Episode%20meetings/Episode%20Meeting%20Jun%2030%202026%20at%20SDU/Agend
 a%20-%20CPDSE%20Episode%20Meeting%20260630.docx?d=wa17531f9c9b0460da224b46
 7b292e390&csf=1&web=1&e=Kkfgr3>.\n\nWe will start the meeting at 10:30 and
  finish the official part of the program at around 17:00. This will be fol
 lowed by a social gathering where we will have pizzas and play games - thi
 s will also take place at SDU.\n\nA couple of highlights will be\n\n  *
 Lightning presentations of PhD projects\n  *   Café sessions with timebox
 ed discussions\n  *   Open space\n  *   Season finale for season 3 and sea
 son transition\n\nWe hope that you will stay for the social gathering as w
 ell but please let Jeppe know if you do not plan on staying for this.\n\nL
 anyard and name tag\nWe kindly ask that you bring your CPDSE lanyard and n
 ame tag (if you got one at the last episode meeting).\n\nLunch\nWe will be
  serving lunch at the meeting\, so we kindly ask that you reply to the inv
 itation\, so we know how many people to expect. If you have any dietary re
 strictions/allergies\, please let Jeppe (jeppe.hartmann@sund.ku.dk<mailto:
 jeppe.hartmann@sund.ku.dk>) know no later than 24 June 2026.\n\nTransporta
 tion\nIf you are going by car to the meeting\, we hope that you will be ab
 le to give others a lift. We kindly ask that you register on this [​xlsx
  icon]  Excel sheet<https://alumni.sharepoint.com/:x:/r/sites/UCPH_CPDSE37
 7/Shared%20Documents/Organization%20and%20Community/Episode%20meetings/Epi
 sode%20Meeting%20Jun%2030%202026%20at%20SDU/CPDSE%20episode%20meeting%20Ju
 n%2030\,%202026%20-%20transportation.xlsx?d=w6b8f55fe48654a309e388da8b6bc5
 ef9&csf=1&web=1&e=DbghwE> if you have room in your car and for those of yo
 u who would like to get a lift to register in the same sheet.\n\nLooking f
 orward to seeing you.\n\nBest\,\nLykke\, Lucy\, Finn\, & Jeppe\n\nJeppe Ha
 rtmann\nProject Coordinator\n\nUniversity of Copenhagen\nDepartment of Dru
 g Design and Pharmacology\n\nUniversitetsparken 2\nDK - 2100 Copenhagen\nD
 enmark\nLync/Skype +45 35323413\njeppe.hartmann@sund.ku.dk<mailto:jeppe.ha
 rtmann@sund.ku.dk>\n\n[Logo for Københavns Universitet]\n\nHow we protect
  personal data<https://informationssikkerhed.ku.dk/english/protection-of-i
 nformation-privacy/privacy-policy/>\n\n\n
