DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Dear all\,\n\nWe are looking forward to seeing y
 ou at our CPDSE center retreat. Please find a couple of practical informat
 ion below.\n\nVenue\nThe retreat will be at Hotel Nyborg Strand<https://ww
 w.nyborgstrand.dk/en/>\, Østerøvej 2\, 5800 Nyborg.\n\nAgenda\nYou can s
 ee the agenda for the retreat via this [​docx icon]  link<https://alumni
 .sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/UCPH_CPDSE377/Shared%20Documents/Organization%
 20and%20Community/Retreat%20-%20S3-S4%20-%202026/CPDSE%20retreat%20-%2025-
 26%20August%202026%20-%20agenda.docx?d=w111ed645d7484bd7adb600cd1c5d2f2d&c
 sf=1&web=1&e=a17WVW>\, and we have also attached a PDF version.\n\nPartici
 pants\nPlease check this [​docx icon]  list<https://alumni.sharepoint.co
 m/:w:/r/sites/UCPH_CPDSE377/Shared%20Documents/Organization%20and%20Commun
 ity/Retreat%20-%20S3-S4%20-%202026/CPDSE%20retreat%20-%2025-26%20August%20
