 we hope you would like to hang out after the dinner. If you have any good
 board games\, please feel free to bring them.\n\nWe would also like to hav
 e some social activities during the retreat so we hope some of you would l
 ike to plan these. It could be running\, bathing\, bird watching - it is a
 ll up to you.\n\nTransportation\nIf you are going by car to the retreat\,
 we hope that you will be able to give others a lift. We kindly ask that yo
 u register on this [​xlsx icon]  Excel sheet<https://alumni.sharepoint.c
 om/:x:/r/sites/UCPH_CPDSE377/Shared%20Documents/Organization%20and%20Commu
