 yv> if you have room in your car and for those of you who would like to ge
 t a lift to register in the same sheet.\n\nWe will be reimbursing your tra
 nsportation costs.\n\nQuestions\nIf you have any questions\, please do not
  hesitate to contact Jeppe.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you all there.\n\
