 t exciting agendas which we will inform you of in advance – but expect t
 o be both inspired and involved. The meetings will only be online.\n\nBase
 d on the feedback we have extended them to last an hour.\n\nLooking forwar
 d to connecting with you.\n\nBest regards\,\nFinn Kollerup\, Jacob Fredega
 ard Hansen\, & Jeppe Hartmann\n___________________________________________
