SEQUENCE:121
DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Dear all\,\n\nWe invite you to this season's fin
 al ConvergenceTalk\, The framework for GAI in teaching at UCPH. The talk i
 s by Ulla Blomhøj and Martin Ibsen from Center for Online and Blended Lea
 rning (COBL)\, UCPH.\n\nAI in education is becoming an increasingly import
 ant topic for both students and teachers. What should we do? How should we
  approach the challenge? How do we talk to our students about it - and wha
 t should we do at all? All of this will be addressed in COBL's presentatio
 n the ConvergenceTalk so join us for this exciting discussion.\n\nThe spea
 kers\nUlla Blomhøj\, Digital Learning Specialist at the Center for Online
  and Blended Learning (COBL).\nMartin Ibsen\, Course Designer at the Cente
 r for Online and Blended Learning (COBL).\n\nThe talk is held at PharmaDat
 aHub@UCPH\, Jagtvej 160\, 1st floor\, and it is also possible to participa
 te via Teams. You are very welcome to join our ConvergenceCoffee from 8:30
 -9:00.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you.\n\nBest\,\nMarin Matic & Jeppe Ha
 rtmann\n__________________________________________________________________
 ______________\nMicrosoft Teams Need help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting
