DESCRIPTION;LANGUAGE=en-US:Dear all\,\n\nThank you for signing up for the C
 onvergenceTalk+ with Stacey Tannenbaum. The title of the talk is Thriving
 Together: Relationships\, Conflict Skills\, and Digital Collaboration.\n\n
 We will be exploring:\n\n  *   Building strong professional relationships\
 n  *   Navigating conflict constructively\n  *   Collaborating effectively
  in digital environments\n\nAbout Stacey\nStacey brings 25+ years of exper
 ience from Metrum\, Astellas\, and Novartis\, and is a co-founder of ISoP
 and ACoP. She has delivered 100+ talks and is widely recognized for helpin
 g scientists strengthen their communication\, leadership\, and impact.\n\n
 It is also possible to participate via Microsoft Teams.\n\nWe will be serv
 ing sandwiches. Feel free to bring your coffee.\n\nWe are looking forward
 to seeing you.\n\nOn behalf of CPDSE\n\nJeppe Hartmann\nProject Coordinato
 r\n\nUniversity of Copenhagen\nDepartment of Drug Design and Pharmacology\
 n\nUniversitetsparken 2\nDK - 2100 Copenhagen\nDenmark\nPhone +45 35323413
 \njeppe.hartmann@sund.ku.dk<mailto:jeppe.hartmann@sund.ku.dk>\n\n[Logo for
  Københavns Universitet]\n\nHow we protect personal data<https://informat
 ionssikkerhed.ku.dk/english/protection-of-information-privacy/privacy-poli
 cy/>\n\n\n________________________________________________________________
 ________________\nMicrosoft Teams meeting\nJoin: https://teams.microsoft.c
 om/meet/359864938659882?p=QlOoOnwfXOcz3ax3kb\nMeeting ID: 359 864 938 659
 882\nPasscode: 5c289Hr7\n________________________________\nNeed help?<http
 s://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-US> | System reference<https://teams.m
 icrosoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_Y2QzMTBiOTgtM2FjNS00NTJjLWI2MmEtZW
 QzMzVmYjY5YjFh%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22a3927f91-cda1-4696-
 af89-8c9f1ceffa91%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%224f33c9c6-7cec-4896-989f-8d511d58f4ea
 %22%7d>\nDial in by phone\n+45 32 72 07 55\,\,538883652#<tel:+4532720755\,
 \,538883652> Denmark\, All locations\nFind a local number<https://dialin.t
 eams.microsoft.com/8fa1ad49-0722-4052-88ca-11fecd3ccf50?id=538883652>\nPho
 ne conference ID: 538 883 652#\nFor organizers: Meeting options<https://te
 ams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?organizerId=4f33c9c6-7cec-4896-989f-8d51
 1d58f4ea&tenantId=a3927f91-cda1-4696-af89-8c9f1ceffa91&threadId=19_meeting
 _Y2QzMTBiOTgtM2FjNS00NTJjLWI2MmEtZWQzMzVmYjY5YjFh@thread.v2&messageId=0&la
 nguage=en-US> | Reset dial-in PIN<https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/p
 stnconferencing>\n________________________________________________________
 ________________________\n\n
